<title>UK: LME to start audio/video monitoring on October 1.</title>
<headline>LME to start audio/video monitoring on October 1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) will start video and audio recording of ring trading from October 1.</p>
<p>In a notice to members, LME Chief Executive David King said &quot;the Board of Directors...resolved to introduce the centralised recording of all ring-dealing members' telephone lines in the ring-dealing area of the Exchange and to introduce video</p>
</text>
